        <Param val="Eye tracker setup&#10;&#10;Please keep your head still and look at the screen.&#10;&#10;We will now calibrate the eye tracker: follow the dot with your eyes and look at its centre until it moves.&#10;&#10;(Experimenter: press SPACE to enter Camera Setup.&#10;Enter = camera image, C = calibrate, V = validate, O = continue to the task.)" valType="str" updates="constant" name="text" />
